    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goldrot is a first-person horror  game where you  delve into caves and mines in search of a legendary alchemical recipe for gold. As a member of the BMG (Bearded Miners Guild), you've been sent deep underground to complete its most ambitious \u2014 and probably cursed \u2014 excavation. Survive deadly traps and creatures, craft with volatile minerals, and uncover the secrets of the guild\u2019s most dangerous mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/cf4d2b5c60ba089d77207c026a467158.avif?t=1752759523\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about finding the right mineral \u2014 it\u2019s about surviving long enough to use it. Carry your findings back to the Elevator, but be careful: one drop might cause a shattering explosion, a blinding flash, or worse. Each mineral has unique properties, and missteps can be deadly. No pressure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/c1558a574863c8a9bb09c258cda29fa4.poster.webp?t=1752759523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/c1558a574863c8a9bb09c258cda29fa4.webp?t=1752759523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=278 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/c3f8da30fb2956407aa978102d5720e0.avif?t=1752759523\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of your operation lies the Elevator \u2014 a station where you process materials through your rusty, yet somehow super-advanced, alchemy machines. Experiment, refine, and unlock new recipes to power your descent into even deeper caves. Only by mastering alchemy will you uncover the mythical gold formula the guild is so desperate to retrieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/847d5813a05f236542d1b9f348bc1692.poster.webp?t=1752759523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/847d5813a05f236542d1b9f348bc1692.webp?t=1752759523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=278 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goldrot is a first-person horror  game where you  delve into caves and mines in search of a legendary alchemical recipe for gold. As a member of the BMG (Bearded Miners Guild), you've been sent deep underground to complete its most ambitious \u2014 and probably cursed \u2014 excavation. Survive deadly traps and creatures, craft with volatile minerals, and uncover the secrets of the guild\u2019s most dangerous mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/cf4d2b5c60ba089d77207c026a467158.avif?t=1752759523\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about finding the right mineral \u2014 it\u2019s about surviving long enough to use it. Carry your findings back to the Elevator, but be careful: one drop might cause a shattering explosion, a blinding flash, or worse. Each mineral has unique properties, and missteps can be deadly. No pressure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/c1558a574863c8a9bb09c258cda29fa4.poster.webp?t=1752759523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/c1558a574863c8a9bb09c258cda29fa4.webp?t=1752759523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=278 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/c3f8da30fb2956407aa978102d5720e0.avif?t=1752759523\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of your operation lies the Elevator \u2014 a station where you process materials through your rusty, yet somehow super-advanced, alchemy machines. Experiment, refine, and unlock new recipes to power your descent into even deeper caves. Only by mastering alchemy will you uncover the mythical gold formula the guild is so desperate to retrieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/847d5813a05f236542d1b9f348bc1692.poster.webp?t=1752759523\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774220/extras/847d5813a05f236542d1b9f348bc1692.webp?t=1752759523\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=278 /></picture></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore dark, procedurally generated caves, mine volatile minerals, and experiment with unstable alchemy in a desperate search for gold. Just move fast \u2014 and whatever you do, don\u2019t drop anything.",
